<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Yujiulü Datan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 429</span> · <a href="/centuries/5th-century">5th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Yujiulü Datan was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khagan">khagan</a> of the Rouran from 414 to 429. Soon after the death of the Northern Wei emperor Mingyuan in 423 he raided the Wei heartland around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shengle">Shengle</a> with a large cavalry army. In 429 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-taiwu-of-northern-wei">Emperor Taiwu of Northern Wei</a> led a great expedition into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongolia">Mongolia</a> that routed the Rouran, and Datan died soon afterwards.</p></div>
